+00:00","Message":"opencode: lazy-load top-level CLI commands\n\nThe CLI imports every top-level command before argument parsing has\ndecided which handler will run. This makes simple invocations pay for\nthe full command graph up front and slows down the default startup path.\n\nParse the root argv first and load only the command module that matches\nthe selected top-level command. Keep falling back to the default TUI\npath for non-command positionals, and preserve root help, version and\ncompletion handling"},{"Sha":"b0600664abacabc3b6bd41de88859248bc2a2594","Login":"rekram1-node","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Aiden Cline","AuthorEmail":"63023139\u002Brekram1-node@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-09T17:06:26+00:00","Message":"feat: add support for fast modes for claude and gpt models (that support it) (#21706)"},{"Sha":"581a7692ffd1a8d675f6f34905db1f6935a2b8c3","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-09T17:01:08+00:00","Message":"fix(tui): restore hidden session scrollbar default (#20947)"},{"Sha":"f73e4d5d31343a2e975d4213c45d1b5fa1c58e75","Login":"opencode-agent[bot]","IsBot":true,"AuthorName":"opencode-agent[bot]","AuthorEmail":"opencode-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-09T16:47:02+00:00","Message":"chore: generate"},{"Sha":"a7743e646736f3fe7ae92c6a54c5ac125ba5ce70","Login":"egze","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Aleksandr Lossenko","AuthorEmail":"aleksandr.lossenko@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-09T16:45:52+00:00","Message":"feat(mcp): add OAuth redirect URI configuration for MCP servers (#21385)\n\nCo-authored-by: Aiden Cline \u003C63023139\u002Brekram1-node@users.noreply.github.com\u003E"},{"Sha":"5d3dba666ca5346510163881a3943a4608fe886d","Login":null,"IsBot":true,"AuthorName":"opencode","AuthorEmail":"opencode@sst.dev","Date":"2026-04-09T16:24:43+00:00","Message":"release: v1.4.2"},{"Sha":"bd53b651a305dd62ffbb5b5a333394df36bb20ab","Login":"thdxr","IsBot":false,"Auth